<!--
  User-facing text for the GUI.

  Keys shared with the audio.cpp web UI keep upstream's name and upstream's
  exact English, so tools/locales/import_webui_locales.py can carry that key's
  translations over. Changing the English of one of those keys without changing
  it upstream makes the import fail, on purpose — a translation of text we no
  longer show is worse than no translation.

  Keys that are ours alone are named for where they appear, and stay English in
  every language until someone supplies a translation.
-->
